{"id":"g0376","title":"Polygonatum officinale (ext.)","description":"Lässt Bindegewebe weicher und geschmeidiger werden, z. B. bei Phimose oder Labiensynechie im Kindesalter, Sehnenverhärtungen und Narbenkontrakturen.","blocks":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hersteller"}]},{"type":"text","text":": WELEDA. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Zusammensetzung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 10 g Salbe enthalten 1,5 g Polygonatum odoratum, Rhizoma Ø (= 5 %). "}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","id":"med-basics","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","id":"guideline","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Leitgedanke"}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"guideline-basics","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Die äußere Anwendung von Polygonatum lässt das Bindegewebe weicher und geschmeidiger werden."}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"Indikationen"}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"indication","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Phimose im Kindesalter "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1011","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 1 x tgl. abds. z.B. mit Wattestäbchen auftragen, dabei Vorhaut zart so weit wie möglich zurückziehen (cave Vernarbungen). Im Behandlungsverlauf nach Baden in der Badewanne Vorhaut vorsichtig zurückziehen, bis sich die Verklebungen allmählich lösen. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Ca. 4–6 Wo. Die Rate operativer Eingriffe konnte in eigener Praxis um > 50 % reduziert werden. Bei vielen Kollegen bewährt. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 3 Mo., nach Pause ggf. wiederholen. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtende Ärzte"}]},{"type":"text","text":": GS, DSe, LJ. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bestätigung von"}]},{"type":"text","text":": NiS. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Labiensynechie im Kindesalter "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1012","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 1–2 x tgl. lokal auftragen. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Nach 2–3 Wo. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Ca. 4–6 Wo. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Weitere Empfehlungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Nachbehandlung mit "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g2253.html","id":"12316","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Quercus Salbe"}]},{"type":"text","text":" WALA. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtende Ärzte"}]},{"type":"text","text":": BB, GS. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bestätigungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Wirksam in circa 50 %. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bestätigung von"}]},{"type":"text","text":": NiS. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Lichen sclerosus et atrophicus "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a2126","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","id":"accordionInnerIndikation","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"inline","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Fallvignette: Beschwerden bei Lichen sclerosus et atrophicus im Genitalbereich"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"c176","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Eine Patientin, die zwischen ihrem 4. und 9. Lebensjahr sexuellen Missbrauch durch verschiedene Personen erlitten hatte, erkrankte im 55. Lebensjahr an Lichen sclerosus et atrophicus im Genitalbereich. "}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Topische Steroide wollte sie nicht anwenden. "}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Eine Behandlung mit 2 x tgl. 1 Msp. "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0057.html","id":"12317","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Argentit"}]},{"type":"text","text":" D6 Trit. WELEDA, "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0291.html","id":"12318","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hepatodoron®"}]},{"type":"text","text":" WELEDA abds. und Polygonatum officinale 5 % Salbe WELEDA z.N. lokal wurde begonnen. Nach Erfahrung mit diversen, durch Gynäkologen und Dermatologen verordneten Cremes, nannte die Patientin sie „die beste aller Salben“. Durch eine Dermatologin wurde eine Kurmaßnahme mit Moorbädern verordnet, die die Patientin zeitweise auch zu Hause 2 x/Wo. durchführt. "}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Der Befund schritt langsam voran, bis zur Einsendung ohne wesentliche Beeinträchtigung. "}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bericht von Irene Stiltz"}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Sehnenverhärtungen und Sehnenknoten "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1010","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Tendovaginitis stenosans. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Karpaltunnelsyndrom auf der Basis von Sehnenscheidenentzündungen. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Schnellender Finger. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Dupuytrensche Kontraktur. "}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 2 x tgl. intensiv einmassieren. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Nach 4 Wo. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Einige Wochen. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Weitere Empfehlungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Komedikation mit "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0421.html","id":"12319","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Stannum metallicum (ext.)"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 0,4 % Salbe WELEDA, innerlich "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0053.html","id":"12320","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Arandisit"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (Rezepturpräparat). "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtende Ärzte"}]},{"type":"text","text":": MS, HvL, Red. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bestätigungen"}]},{"type"